# Dependencies — only ever needed to regenerate the icons or run the tests.
# Nothing the deployed app serves comes from here.
node_modules/

# Vercel's local project link, created by `vercel link`.
.vercel/

# config.js is NOT ignored, deliberately. It holds the project URL and the
# anon key, both publishable — and Vercel deploys from this repo, so ignoring it
# would mean the deployed site 404s on the script and can never sign in.
# See the comment at the top of config.js.
#
# What must never be committed, in any file: a `sb_secret_...` key or an older
# `service_role` JWT. Those ignore every RLS policy and amount to full database
# access for anyone who reads them.

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
